@startuml 用户登录时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "登录页面UI\n(auth-login)" as UI
participant "认证工具\n(auth.js)" as Auth
participant "请求工具\n(request.js)" as Request
participant "云函数\n(api)" as CloudFunc
participant "Express后端\n(可选)" as Express
database "云数据库\n(users集合)" as CloudDB
database "MongoDB\n(可选)" as MongoDB

User -> UI: 输入账号、密码、身份
activate UI

UI -> Auth: 调用login()\n验证输入
activate Auth
Auth -> Auth: 检查字段有效性
Auth --> UI: 返回验证结果
deactivate Auth

UI -> Request: callApi('auth/login',\n{username, password, role})
activate Request

alt 云函数路由
  Request -> CloudFunc: 调用云函数
  activate CloudFunc
  CloudFunc -> CloudDB: 查询用户数据\n(username)
  activate CloudDB
  CloudDB --> CloudFunc: 返回用户记录
  deactivate CloudDB
  
  CloudFunc -> CloudFunc: 验证密码
  CloudFunc -> CloudFunc: 验证身份角色
  CloudFunc --> Request: 返回结果\n{ok: true, user: {...}}
  deactivate CloudFunc
  
else Express后端路由
  Request -> Express: 调用Express API\nPOST /auth/login
  activate Express
  Express -> MongoDB: 查询用户数据
  activate MongoDB
  MongoDB --> Express: 返回用户记录
  deactivate MongoDB
  
  Express -> Express: 验证密码和角色
  Express --> Request: 返回用户信息
  deactivate Express
end

Request --> UI: 返回用户对象
deactivate Request

UI -> UI: 保存到wx.storage\n(本地存储)
UI -> UI: 保存到app.globalData\n(全局变量)

UI --> User: 显示成功提示
UI --> User: 跳转到首页
deactivate UI

@enduml

